Package: com.itsallexb.defaultbrowser
Name: DefaultBrowser (iOS 12)
Version: 2.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Opens http/https links from other apps in the browser you pick (Firefox, Chrome, Brave, DuckDuckGo, Edge, Firefox Focus...) instead of Safari (iOS 12). Settings > Default Browser. Replaces FirefoxDefault.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 12.0), firmware (<< 13.0), preferenceloader
Replaces: com.itsallexb.firefoxdefault
Conflicts: com.itsallexb.firefoxdefault
Provides: com.itsallexb.firefoxdefault
